{
  "id": "poem-5b0e65089bd0ad46b29865b6",
  "title": "玉蝴蝶·霞帔云发",
  "author": "温庭筠",
  "dynasty": "唐",
  "verses": [
    "秋风凄切伤离，行客未归时。",
    "塞外草先衰江，南雁到迟。",
    "芙蓉凋嫩脸，杨柳堕新眉。",
    "摇落使人悲，断肠谁得知。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "花间集",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/五代诗词/huajianji/huajianji-1-juan.json#record-49",
